OL,3,ARussell Brand found guilty of rape and
OL,4,Athree sexual assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fone count of rape and three counts of
OL,8,Fsexual assault - read a summary of his
OL,9,Foffences here
OL,11,FThe judge tells him "obviously a
OL,12,Fcustodial sentence of some length will
OL,13,Fresult"
OL,15,FThe comedian and actor, 51, has been
OL,16,Fremanded in custody and will be
OL,17,Fsentenced on Monday
OL,19,FBrand faced seven charges: three of
OL,20,Frape, three of sexual assault and one
OL,21,Fof attempted indecent assault. He was
OL,22,Ffound not guilty on three counts
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
