OL,3,AVance walks Trump tightrope with
OL,4,Ascathing election critique blaming Iran
OL,5,Awar
OL,6,
OL,7,FVice-President JD Vance sent shockwaves
OL,8,Fthrough Washington on Wednesday by
OL,9,Fblaming his party's midterm defeat
OL,10,Fsquarely on the Iran war, in what was
OL,11,Fwidely interpreted as an effort to
OL,12,Fdistance himself from President Donald
OL,13,FTrump ahead of a potential 2028 White
OL,14,FHouse run.
OL,16,FIn a carefully calibrated, 600-word
OL,17,Fstatement on X, the vice-president
OL,18,Facknowledged that Trump's 2024 voters
OL,19,Fhad deserted Republicans in the midterm
OL,20,Felection.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
